sequenceDiagram
  participant Sensor
  participant MCU as ESP32 Firmware
  participant Blynk as Blynk Cloud
  participant UI as Mobile/Web Dashboard
  Sensor->>MCU: Read sensor on timed interval
  MCU->>Blynk: Write telemetry to V0/V1
  Blynk->>UI: Update bound widgets
  UI->>Blynk: User changes V2 switch
  Blynk->>MCU: BLYNK_WRITE(V2) callback
  MCU->>MCU: Validate command and set output
